    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This reference text, written by Dr. Stuart Sargent, who donated Sakushi Kaitei to the Stanford University Libraries, provides an introduction to the work with extensive references.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Table of contents: Introduction. Genesis of the Volumes. The Editors. Provenance of the Stanford Copy. Detailed Contents of the First Volume: I. Sakushi kaitei 作詩階梯. II. Japanese translation of the Qiuxing ge shihua 秋星閣詩話by Li Yi 李沂 (1556 – 1614). III. Shiwa no shiwa詩話の詩話. IV. Shikū Hyosei Nijuyon shihin chūshaku 司空表聖二十四詩品註釋. V. Shi ben 詩辯. VI. Shiji seigo 四字成語. VII. Kanshi no kanshō 漢詩の鑑賞, by Kawashima Seidō 川島清堂 (1886 – 1946). Contents of the Second Volume",
            "type": "table of contents",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        }
